OL,3,GNEWSATree planting to begin at delayed
OL,4,Aforest project
OL,5,
OL,6,FTree planting is to begin on a new
OL,7,Fcommunity forest project after the High
OL,8,FCourt dismissed a legal challenge
OL,9,Fagainst it.
OL,11,FAlmost 300 hectares of woodland will be
OL,12,Fcreated at Greencroft Forest Park in
OL,13,FCounty Durham, making it "England's
OL,14,Flargest new productive and mixed
OL,15,Fwoodland in over 40 years", according
OL,16,Fto investment firm True North.
OL,18,FThe project was put on hold after a
OL,19,Flegal challenge by local firm
OL,20,FLanchester Properties, but judges ruled
OL,21,Fin favour of the developers in July
OL,22,F2026.
OL,23,APub: 04-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,398,390,260,160,0,100
